# Packages "Try Omarchy" installs into the live overlay from the offline
# mirror. Everything here must already be in the mirror (it is: all of it is
# in omarchy-base.packages or its closure), so the list adds no bytes to the
# ISO. Kept small on purpose — every other Omarchy app is one
# omarchy-install-app away inside the session, from the same mirror.
omarchy
mesa
vulkan-radeon
vulkan-intel
networkmanager
noto-fonts
noto-fonts-emoji
foot
